          "style": "",
          "styledegree": "",
          "text": "救回九个赛点，萨巴伦卡仍然出局。",
          "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
        },
        "request_id": "156cec791ba5b6317df39659e2f537eeef67c494abd050246f311d9c706969d7"
      },
      {
        "audio_sha256": "ca60c33bfd9f250037bc258fb043647c0e5bd668c7324feb5296f951181df1f7",
        "duration_seconds": 7.752,
        "marks_sha256": "4726451d2adefb13a34197153d59e7fae197f31ddb0a2714494d4a58030ce428",
        "request": {
          "backend": "edge",
          "cache_key": "12a89ffe91748232ad44f2151df2dead",
          "lead_pause": 0.0,
          "pitch": "+0Hz",
          "rate": "+6%",
          "style": "",
          "styledegree": "",
          "text": "追到六比六，抢七却又三比六。萨巴伦卡连续救回两个赛点，比分追到五比六。",
          "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
        },
        "request_id": "1b08d2ccdc733573df047d70580d32b784b360aa75982fb7725b916549eed22b"
      },
      {
        "audio_sha256": "d4b8e93e51881d0394e8f0788780c3dca5c73196b98f2af56e36cd9393820390",
        "duration_seconds": 5.496,
        "marks_sha256": "7c60116bf8ca4d7ddc7ecadbd82e8762ee02ea2500fa3ce0dd353a463f097fe0",
        "request": {
          "backend": "edge",
          "cache_key": "b909a216098b164db4e562a143e61da6",
          "lead_pause": 0.0,
          "pitch": "+0Hz",
          "rate": "+6%",
          "style": "",
          "styledegree": "",
          "text": "但从四比二到四比六，她连输四局。比赛进入决胜盘。",
          "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
        },
        "request_id": "5e5b5a261865e7c166c38dba2c2f31a675bd8ef553c7cb60314ecdb359535023"
      },
      {
        "audio_sha256": "17d991b27ce174270470596e625a756e6021b4cc0be0cf111184e855d3971887",
        "duration_seconds": 9.696,
        "marks_sha256": "a1bb6bf74cba4b86d2efb6c0d69ba33776ebe180afd0e3503e84ba87f23abb0f",
        "request": {
          "backend": "edge",
          "cache_key": "a46169d7fc062ba1afc55397c3de7d5d",
          "lead_pause": 0.0,
          "pitch": "+0Hz",
          "rate": "+6%",
          "style": "",
          "styledegree": "",
          "text": "决胜盘二比五，萨巴伦卡陷入绝境。第八局救回五个赛点，随后上网抢分追到四比五，第十局再救两个。",
          "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
        },
        "request_id": "695b4b52f8f7bff86a5fe5174c951501ee701784354dbd939ec81056f58985ff"
      },
      {
        "audio_sha256": "1153bb02380f858de8c4350c5301e9818e22768c82c813469c1b80133367ac74",
        "duration_seconds": 4.152,
        "marks_sha256": "bf33e7d2af5679adb575e53259c0e0aa92a351b65570fe9e3f33055321608898",
        "request": {
          "backend": "edge",
          "cache_key": "7559865dbf4339cccd83a16a1f56beb8",
          "lead_pause": 0.0,
          "pitch": "+0Hz",
          "rate": "+6%",
          "style": "",
          "styledegree": "",
          "text": "关注网球时差，时差归我，好球归你。",
          "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
        },
        "request_id": "75c73f1202071699a9595e6df6c2f0ef0dde6a4732e4b8ebf904ed99e156b312"
      },
      {
        "audio_sha256": "d63d31bdfd506451656c8580539c39e09f477a05a4f88652d5de25704afa381e",
        "duration_seconds": 7.8,
        "marks_sha256": "e2ed40cea96f98eb1582a841bb4fa6a16fc874aabd6a033198b66a313cfd43c2",
        "request": {
          "backend": "edge",
          "cache_key": "4b42c609a2f67063529640ae5b466e51",
          "lead_pause": 0.0,
          "pitch": "+0Hz",
          "rate": "+6%",
          "style": "",
          "styledegree": "",
          "text": "北京时间十月十四日晚，武汉第二轮。萨巴伦卡世界第二，对手李吉妮世界第三十一。",
          "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
        },
        "request_id": "b1b8c6580750955377112384bf704220190b9e960df7bd9a689fb348ef8d8cfe"
